WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.449
At a gala, a guest tries your product.

00:00:02.852 --> 00:00:05.476
A week later,
they remember the conversation.

00:00:05.874 --> 00:00:07.564
Where should that first meeting happen?

00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:09.583
There are three ways we can help.

00:00:09.981 --> 00:00:12.523
First, activate at an existing event.

00:00:12.921 --> 00:00:16.080
We agree on the audience
and the action, coordinate

00:00:16.094 --> 00:00:20.201
with the organizer, train the hosts,
and follow up on results.

00:00:20.599 --> 00:00:25.091
Second, partner with an experience we
produce or are authorized to support.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:29.308
Sampling, sponsorships
and live demos depend on the event,

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:32.083
the agreed benefits and available space.

00:00:32.481 --> 00:00:34.473
Third, create your own brand event.

00:00:34.871 --> 00:00:39.061
From a customer showcase to a product
launch, we direct the program,

00:00:39.432 --> 00:00:43.882
catering, décor, multimedia,
staffing and logistics.

00:00:44.281 --> 00:00:47.440
Our team produces more than two hundred
and fifty small

00:00:47.454 --> 00:00:51.190
and midsize events each year,
in addition to corporate productions.

00:00:51.588 --> 00:00:55.435
We coordinate the experience from the
first brief through the last guest.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.141
Tell us who you want to reach
and what you want them to do.

00:00:58.539 --> 00:01:01.547
Create your brand experience
with VNV Events.
